 ['προπυλών','Customary local relation with προ-: retains the final acute.'],
 ['προθυρών','Customary local relation with προ-: retains the final acute.'],
 ['Ἀνακρέων','Compound from a barytone: non-final acute.'],
 ['Χαμαιλέων','Compound from a barytone: non-final acute.'],
 ['φιλοξενοφῶν','Compound from a circumflexed word: retains the circumflex.'],
